{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1378,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8973e8f252afeaedfc361254",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然还是有点不安，\r\n但是不用你担心。\r\n……只要做好该做的事情就行了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2997f89cf1ec53be898f6f225f73414480504767aabcb28bccea312bff25c243",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7aef9b78bb310552d74367fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冷静不下来……\r\n可能稍微有点焦躁了吧……\r\n……得跑出自己的水平才行……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5948e77e4aa3cc2828d45f1309e276ee97b6f467e82f5738e1b40066e87ca56c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ad22aababf5604fed631ab0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么观众这么多啊……\r\n啊啊真是的……！\r\n振作点啊，目白多伯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "77e594807332814c50fe58e209372fc8f1a4c7aa554ec9eb8da19b2f4782db0a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0029d74700fad63db25b4f57",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已经能感受到大家的热情了……\r\n……可、可不能先输了气势啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9eeeadcb377361f0bc1cd9c5c37ccdc89f3629ee1bd579d374c0e69274a1e89b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36f28519756456ab64470236",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个……我现在表情看上去怎么样？\r\n……算了，还是别说了。\r\n总之现在得加油才行……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a581f5ba4ed2662823f6ea9f595e76ad2db1970153b7c0d8e6bdd3f149f8056",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8ccd8ef4e7ae59dff767304",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我上了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "980a7ec4edfa6d1adf15641f4347f9c2840126ff143da4b3a0db3ad63034d737",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1665fe1ac51a99ce479317fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f93d3b7ef27d7cc0857d72ec2a4909bbb86efae229156b450540a7bebfc972c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c907cc1b30d99196b065d27",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好好努力过了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed6a9e31a19c7ac61d05e5b03b863244e1825d19afa23ad40a7a8e32cc97e72a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df50fb271d9abe89c5676882",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冷静一点……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee114266be5fd2408e3f714a378546c8d2745b9f0ecdac860240869489a2af32",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d364bb39d86409001fef5b4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么会……？！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e5d8d87ca3869b55673838d2923b1ffc8b0c6e2e3a4a142e791e0e8e6e5b108",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94c80988afb85cbc653edcc0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "67d0eeceded72eace8823cc24b753a0a3007c8ea0e0a4fc8073e9cf559b5eb03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cadf5c7dfba8bdc27bda2920",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那，上吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48cff60aa19885b7edbdc44919f3ff03ca1f9efc2f099a723d43500846dac3c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2e398abf25456ef3cf84bc7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真美呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "51bd4302b66f94cc685a0dd130ef84dc59302eec70db1b3bbcff9dd1261484f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a819444401e238da17f7a62",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "毕竟也努力了这么久了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c228e61d66df6c04b5c32ca5d4851ea870fd69619fc9fe2533a94d984776f1d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a45dce7811c5602022c9aa2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你，训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fe14dbaa33cedbb8817cc5c67738ef9044c00c157d89590bd87233379d01774",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0db9845201c4c0ef49fa7e4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不想被甩开的话，就得加把劲……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9703dae9567ecae6bcd956f276c3d9c4559c0ceaee0d192f8f12e1e86e2f5496",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70c1f65f6d609cfa2cef680b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……总觉得身体有些沉重啊。\r\n啊，没事的。\r\n这点程度还不成大碍。",
      "source_fingerprint": "88a2421af1e18b30d7d4500cd09beed6a53e2210d8ef028b4127761759d3022f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "20100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c13803892bac226ee68e05a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈啊……有点累了啊。\r\n我可以稍微休息一会儿吗？\r\n这样一来也能继续努力了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3197b761e8a9f6858a984d11cc5c4fab9fcbab10e6dd8fcb985bf5911379e7e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "20101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3aee4fadb920d06c4001716",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，今天也得加油呢。\r\n能说说看你的计划吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f084c4b95c778b9ef957c5ace6d9e398d764d310912f4ab3ddf5345075fd7245",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "20106"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a0fb889990076defd9aabc0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈啊……啊，抱歉。\r\n不小心又开始叹气了。\r\n不过……总有点提不起精神……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8be49a014e5b102b36bd6019057ca597f0f4530f7b9c99f73b9b3289765e6a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "20109"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e9d1eb5f0ed34f1d26f9267",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶？又要参加比赛吗？\r\n……虽然我也很想参加啦，\r\n但总觉得现在没什么胜算……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d53f667a9028ce5dc16b69e59aa2e0e02b08326446b231f421b1f1f0d9d93d68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "20121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0201536d59c0a3e87adab43b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……是吗。\r\n不过，一直参加比赛的话，\r\n我也会有点吃不消吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e717dab96df268b76064aa462488cfa799d97bcd04e98e0242671aaaf70f548",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "20122"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8775b76136e7509fcaca9e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说实话，现在还是有些不安……\r\n但只要做好该做的事就好了吧……\r\n请给哦加油哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3e4446b6ee44ac16ae45fb6b6d9590a175aec8a3976dedb2b6b767eb2d68445",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "20133"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77093c44320b1a179a6d1227",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家，上吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1549c847d674bffca5b8a80dea6fddd5ebfcad7057e99d588df7830057c80bcf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea13ccd56fb75ba60261cef0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要全力以赴了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a784a9cd790e71d5f1627d9a2b2c27398117813096dabde423bf6b00e7b510d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7a74df50e7bf5e26bb4325f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你，训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fe14dbaa33cedbb8817cc5c67738ef9044c00c157d89590bd87233379d01774",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76a6705f1ef7ca2cd3f0e7be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼……现在一点儿也不紧张，感觉不错呢。\r\n接下来就只差气势了……好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e01ae4a6e7511698a7c34cffbb8a53eca14cc9fd068f97e8e93ccab9b1c7b95b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b79dda97632d109f0a932711",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼……吸……嗯，好了。\r\n一定不会让为今天而付出的努力白费！",
      "source_fingerprint": "770e4310b7826567da67abbc685409f5cc8425da209871b11db1ecc4ff8120cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5036ef6733ff5acc9cda8a42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢您，训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4de93278fdfed03e7efbd515733d92932a8d97c415653ff733482b8056717710",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bb7c0b61df5a530c3c2aee0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "よし…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "102be444c7c1e00b22b7731dfa734b449c0115aff69d08289378634098da8a4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b17818138a8153968c108a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好不够，还可以继续的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4eb53cd88be8592e90f8eaf83e0e8443a54fa2cdc63b01040fdaa1969dc953e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49bc42a8a238f44bf5496b1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算是我，也想继续前进……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "036fc307d4e5321fe6a4cbbea2941785025f1cc90d6e9984ad39240c8a38326d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9ab263d6f97b94d936fa996",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会继续努力的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e83b69e0824221f23c4314c9bbeb60a992380c450e5207b8af47a8c73a8ba03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e670dadf0f13bb1d4b0f867",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我才不会就这样放弃……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbb75bf8017dcf90764a2f4b3f4404e1d2527110cf8aa6994f9723bc33dac1df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2de601b5ad9816c99061692e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然还不大习惯收到夸奖……但感觉还不赖。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5342604139752cd854bc32d5b7ccdb368de013fe22353b81ea603b05ff2d78e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:018b3f2330e183381e1053c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算是我……也能做到的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "90491da66a536f521cd95e9835206458571dd398c601e977071980c4038ecf2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59ee953cb0692a97ccf24cfa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟我一起前进吧。\r\n接下来……我会带你去往更加美妙的地方！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0722b6ff6bec1b007e34119b6bf1ab999aa56212701553169fda7cecc3215e5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be94bd5008a987875672ad15",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我也能……做到的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b58387fece0a5851175a5f8d4e4d9d53b2547ecb477f7160daf1587ad47c31b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc3f8e9157eddfb2ccf5bafd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只注视着终点……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7f5f1285cb0661f8321d766bb1db45288114ee2f518f6b6caef227c22af1ee0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69e290ac73a801e322a95376",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我——要朝着心中的目标前进！",
      "source_fingerprint": "33f3969cf2e2dd930b5d4894d4aff5dd5c27af2afd6e3dc4097d4641c5aa7c5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5453b2211cbd15fec338366a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要说到户外烧烤要准备的东西……\r\n钓竿……可能还得租辆自行车……！\r\n嗯，一定会很开心的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ee66e96d5320596dc595c9dcb91bdf65f6e3ef26f9dda053a3e73ef71fd2c21",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "400000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c9df3a9a05ba533f98b85eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アタシがクリスマス・ナイトを\r\n楽しめたのは…ライアンがいつも\r\n隣でフォローしてくれたからなんだ",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7a07855a364b8eafff29814faf715976f961def3e47cde8b893c0e9c0e4743a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7ac6ca459fd367d2ecc89bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…そうだ、エアグルーヴ先輩たちに\r\nお礼しなきゃ。お茶会のクッキー\r\nおいしかったし、お店聞いてみよう",
      "source_fingerprint": "657066514f6828eeed1c39fed7228727c36d2781eba3a38296aba01835371ae2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "400003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:011cc459e65e02bf52f8eaf4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "论信念的强弱的话，\r\n我也不会输给气槽前辈。\r\n……我想要改变自己。我想要变得更强。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddae4fed954c474a6fbd58011e383873705c7f9eff930c69c956bba6b5c99726",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "400004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2c7179e4d14a4d40666e3c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "仲夏夜真是不可意思呀。\r\n感觉自己也多少变得率直些了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed464f918483f0bb931bf4e8850edf99482b19b412ae81623f262c63d280004d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "400008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b324c7e1ac9f0acbcdb2cb26",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "包围着我的视线……声音……\r\n不要看我——啊！\r\n原来如此……我只要向着我心中的目标前进就行了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9a87081580207a4d86903f2e863f1ca11623f503e5263265f99ba31fc647c11",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea9f3cfb2778e3ebfba702e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大树给我拍了一大堆照片，\r\n其中还有不少照片不知道是啥时候拍的……\r\n嗯，太好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a707b054d33c25418ebc2e7b433d6c998c647df1bf3ef4cf435881e483ba592",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "400010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab667e829b81f7b9209ed3e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有活动任务呢。\r\n……我姑且也是觉得该尽量做好能做到的事情的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "efafcc1c4555d7d739a14c44d9d92f8a8b760356d9348fafdff0c48757200caa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dc8c5c04177c4cdd7dfdb11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动任务辛苦你了。\r\n记得去领取任务报酬哦。\r\n……这可是你努力的证据呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c57e7964058dc3ca511cf98340b45eccd05b662ad4020ad28cff556b78d83e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24b1d5e521dfc5d7e428c027",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼哇……今天就早点睡吧……\r\n啊。在此之前，\r\n得先跟赖恩讲讲这次露营的事儿呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b8020a482ad2560823b1de7d914b0b7a46a4f980e2f571f24a8db993bbee083",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "400014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a5e0c84bee7d7888b4661a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "抓到你啦～！哎呀，真是的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "95683de6611e10c02f642611933310abf3359aa4334f39c2f1db8059b8d3cf44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3c913cd1e852bdd4e051f02",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯？哇啊……等、等等啦！哇啊～谢谢你带我找到这里哦……呵呵♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3059d842990aa147d61e93df3b7c350d85c764331c89da8feeb784da54f8d065",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14a40e51ed19d119518e9273",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜呜……每每和高峰说话时，\r\n便会不由自主地紧张起来……！\r\n就好像……一切都被她看穿了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4319567046160379ed02f40cab80bb2d7d994d3265db9d19b13735828f58fa2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "400048"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8be1c2bc4284872d6eb9748",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没关系、没关系……要、要上了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f963eaa905647d3ad71479719906b6ad02f2e6b37a702e4b0e20734de2b1e0dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebba9ab8a0c76abae30c848f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "得把我的心意传递出去才行……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5f23e424099aa07eabfc2e580454b04d0e9b9e1377f5ae884f2815366777c43",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e66d023a7ae3ff0b3caa840",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起……努力把该做的事情……做好吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49f68adabc09e2df793364f64dd74a0376c8aeaaa0c23c9510a0475982f55b83",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a929af70b99e2c9cee0e68c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然一开始挺担心能不能和你做好搭档的……\r\n但现在已经没关系了。\r\n……我们都习惯彼此了嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "322d632cdfc7a89c536fc404b2735a3cd294b29c11ff2f56e1044faa2d04f360",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f9cc0a1dec0440d6b7bd586",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为这套制服和大家的都一样，\r\n所以不会受到莫名的关注，我还蛮喜欢的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e6169b35d6313931c405151160198cdc21238dd0d037fb8e8f5dcccfab2f563",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b01510eda19e73d23f57f45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这么可爱的衣服……\r\n是不是和我不太搭啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab6d772a16902541c539fa5be62ce458460363564334fbb48f75f2eaad2d8853",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6ca3c468511bca531733e08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是我自己决定的决胜服……\r\n得昂首挺胸地穿上它才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c685ac45984ba5c584405663b1361228f338857885b37aec0ebb78a33aeffbac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa577d9a8a27e6f5818da37e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要穿上这身衣服，\r\n马上就会被认出是特雷森学园的学生。\r\n得拿出精气神儿才行……",
      "source_fingerprint": "743c75bf160c25b96eecfcf97d5bee2df9dcb05e499324c79d1701618bb4d90b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82157220fe4a1bd5b2845b3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然站在舞台上还是有点紧张……\r\n但一定得好好传达我的谢意才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9883d93cd4407076227e4c78322abbdc5cf391d3b999f16ebe5ad8546205020f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8a7a88b7a1da887b853167c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我一定会展现出配得上这套衣服的奔跑的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e77b32ae4fd508fd1f15b718782dacd73a0eedc0fd150d005ce77b0398f4007",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8c50635e62f6b2ba7ebf2ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "清新的微风与平静的水面……\r\n能亲身感受这一切真是太好了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a5938b82d847be12d07ad628d518ebbf7247096bccf25da0ce068e6d9fab70d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc325c31ddd9fc5e1d3ba59e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "接下来要去哪儿？\r\n记得一定要先制定好计划哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91c4c010dcffdfc7090dd3f8c156aa6fdc5b60e0f5b84f2fd2be240ef8629951",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05adfb7b27a9bcb2967448f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……～嘁！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20b9843d1c8543eb3e90e50676fb30df20623535c47ae6d8d27d1e0f99b4f4c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4967ef4926700d22c0128f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如预想那般地奔跑了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f045b7f00c6991110ead2a4e428725e02c1716cca22993746234f40d3eb9a98e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39820a7318b53c3a71c1ebfe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "オンオフの切り替えにはいいかも。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a19da6da24625277678b9f2380dfb4a7876d3ea436fe93d1e046b8bdbbceca27",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef1abd683a25dd523bca520f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私服でも…動けるから。\r\n気にしないで。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc4cae23cf0f9f2e174714088fc40cabaf9b2b0a9e7d1396ae136bf59e858049",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab82414a3cbcb5aa1dd4523a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然一开始还有点不安……\r\n但是我已经决定好要和训练员一起努力了，\r\n所以已经没关系了哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2be247b80b0fea9e3e252241201db94f8317bc76071ba6c19eae7d525dfcae3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "70101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:741bda1762cddbdd4722806d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "結構動きやすいから、\r\nどこでもついて行けるよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3356e1d2b7cb0e0bd854c20d5e14437040a87bf935a9fd6ddb76cd8fc45ee4bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1059",
        "70121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88e01ba6617529ab12b7d1a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为这套制服和大家的都一样，\r\n所以不会受到莫名的关注，我还蛮喜欢的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e6169b35d6313931c405151160198cdc21238dd0d037fb8e8f5dcccfab2f563",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
